Reviewing of the monthly staff payroll journals
Preparing all transfer letters for submission to the bank to effect payments;
Reconciling ledger control accounts, debtors and creditors ledger accounts; and
Preparing Audit supporting schedules for audit purposes;
Competencies and skills
Communication;
Report writing;
Analytical
Others
