Position the organization as the key/lead technology solutions partner for the customer;
Keep abreast with all post sale activities for the customer by working hand in hand with the implementation team;
Undertake regular updates to description documents and ensure they are published in the appropriate manner;
Track and report in detail to line manager on all engagement with customers and ensure all daily, weekly, monthly reports are updated in time;
Support the Finance team on any collections efforts as and when requested;
Propose new ideas for solutions based on market and competitor assessment and customer inquiries;
Participate in customer events and prepare materials for the same if required; and
Provide customer contact details and actively engage customers to attend company seminars and events.
Requirements
A bachelor’s degree in business or related field.
At least 7 years hands on experience in a sales or marketing role preferably in stationery industry especially from other stationery brands
Possess good organizational and time management skills;
